{"articleNo":"101425","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=101425&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014-1학기 생활관 추가합격자 발표","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.21","hit":"5674","attachments":[{"name":"2014-1 생활관 추가합격자 명단(공고용).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=101425&attachNo=73150"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 1학기 생활관 추가 합격자 등록 안내</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"></u>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 1학기 생활관 추가 합격자 등록을 다음과 같이 안내하오니 등록에 착오 없으시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 등록기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 2014. 2. 21(금) 16:00 ~ 22(토) 12:00까지</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 등록대상 : 합격자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 선발방법 : 입사신청서를 제출한 학생 중 선발(신평관 입사자 제외)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 모집인원은 합격자를 제외하고는 후보로 등록되며 환불 등 여석이 발생할 경우 합격자는 개별 연락함.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 계좌번호 : 오름관 농협 301-0141-2149-01 금오공과대학교</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;푸름관 농협 1467-01-001041 금오공과대학교</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 생활관비 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">오름관 1,091,000원(의무식)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 푸름관 457,000원(식사안함), 923,460원(5일식), 1,038,900원(7일식)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 행정사항 :&nbsp;<font color=\"#ef1a1a\">- 등록기간내 미등록시는 불합격으로 처리함.</font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#ef1a1a\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 입금시 반드시&nbsp;학생 본인 이름으로 입금.</font></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 02. 21.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">생 활 관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
